{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-2-1","title":"Revelation 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 What is commanded to be written to the angels, that is, the ministers of the churches of Ephesus, 8 Smyrna, 12 Pergamos, 18 Thyatira, and what is commended or found wanting in them.</p>\n<p>the angel. 8,12,18; 3:1,7,14 church. 1:11 holdeth. 1:16,20; 8:10-12; 12:1; Joh 5:35 walketh. 1:12,13; Eze 28:13,14; Mt 18:20; 28:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-2","title":"Revelation 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>know. 9,13,19; 3:1,8,15; Ps 1:6; Mt 7:23; 1Th 1:3; 2Ti 2:19; Heb 6:10 how. 6,14,15,20,21; Ga 1:7; Eph 4:14; 1Th 5:21; 2Pe 2:1-3; 1Jo 4:1 thou hast. 2Co 11:13-15; 1Jo 2:21,22; 4:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-3","title":"Revelation 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>hast borne. Ps 69:7; Mic 7:9; Mr 15:21; Lu 14:27; 1Co 13:7; Ga 6:2; Heb 13:13 hast patience. 1:9; 3:10; Ps 37:7; Lu 8:15; 21:19; Ro 2:7; 5:3,4; 8:25; 12:12; 15:4,5 Col 1:11; 2Th 3:5; Heb 6:12,15; 10:36; 12:1; Jas 1:3,4; 5:7-11 2Pe 1:6 hast laboured. Ro 16:12; 1Co 16:16; 2Co 5:9; 6:5; 10:15; 11:23; Php 2:16; 4:3 1Th 1:3; 2:9; 5:12; 2Th 3:8; 1Ti 4:10; 5:17; Heb 6:10 hast not. Lu 18:1; 2Co 4:1,16; Ga 6:9; 2Th 3:13; Heb 12:3-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-4","title":"Revelation 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>I have. 14,20 because. 3:14-17; Jer 2:2-5; Mt 24:12,13; Php 1:9; 3:13-16; 1Th 4:9,10 2Th 1:3; Heb 6:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-5","title":"Revelation 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Remember. 3:3,19; Eze 16:61-63; 20:43; 36:31; 2Pe 1:12,13 thou art. Isa 14:12; Ho 14:1; Ga 5:4; Jude 1:24 and repent. 16,21,22; 3:3,19; 9:20,21; 16:9; Ac 17:30,31 and do. 19; 3:2,3; Isa 1:26; Jer 2:2,3; Ho 9:10; Mal 3:4; 4:6; Lu 1:17 else. 16; 3:3; Mt 21:41-43; 24:48-51; Mr 12:9; Lu 12:45,46; 20:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-6","title":"Revelation 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>that. 14,15; 2Ch 19:2; Ps 26:5; 101:3; 139:21,22; 2Jo 1:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-7","title":"Revelation 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>that hath. 11,17,29; 3:6,13,22; 13:9; Mt 11:15; 13:9,43; Mr 7:16 let him. 14:13; 22:17; 1Co 2:10; 12:4-12 To him. 11,17,26-28; 3:5,12,21; 12:10,11; 15:2; 21:7; Joh 16:33; 1Jo 5:4,5 the tree. 22:2,14; Ge 2:9; 3:22-24; Pr 3:18; 11:30; 13:12; 15:4 the paradise. Lu 23:43; 2Co 12:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-8","title":"Revelation 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>the angel. 1 the first. 1:8,11,17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-9","title":"Revelation 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>know. 2 tribulation. 7:14; Joh 16:33; Ac 14:22; Ro 5:3; 8:35; 12:12; 1Th 3:4; 2Th 1:6,7 poverty. Lu 4:18; 6:20; 2Co 8:2,9; Jas 2:5,6 thou art. 3:17,18; Lu 12:21; 2Co 6:10; 1Ti 6:18; Jas 2:5,6 the blasphemy. Lu 22:65; Ac 26:11; 1Ti 1:13 which. Ro 2:17,28,29; 9:6 the synagogue. 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-10","title":"Revelation 2:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Fear. Mt 10:22 shalt. Da 3:16-18; Mt 10:28; Lu 12:4-7 the devil. 12:9-11; 13:2,7,15-17; Lu 21:12; Joh 13:2,27; Eph 2:2; 6:12; 1Pe 5:8 ye shall. 9 ten days. Hab 2:3; 1Pe 1:6,7 be thou. 12:11; Mt 10:22; 24:13; Mr 8:35; 13:13; Lu 21:16-19; Joh 12:25 Ac 20:24; 21:13; 2Ti 4:7,8 a crown. 3:11; Jas 1:12; 1Pe 5:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-11","title":"Revelation 2:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>that hath. 7; 13:9 the second. 20:6,14; 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-12","title":"Revelation 2:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the angel. 1; 1:11 Pergamos.Pergamos, now Bergamo, the ancient metropolis of Mysia, and the residence of the Attalian kings, is situated on the river Caicus, about sixty miles north of Smyrna, in long. 27 degrees E. lat. 39 degrees 11' N. It still retains some measure of its ancient importance; containing a population of 15,000 souls, and having nine or ten mosques, two churches, and one synagogue.</p>\n<p>which hath. 16; 1:16; 19:15,21; Isa 11:4; Heb 4:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-13","title":"Revelation 2:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>know. 2,9 Satan's. 9,10,24; 3:9 thou holdest. 25; 3:3,11; 1Th 5:21; 2Ti 1:13; Heb 3:6; 10:23 my name. 3:8; Mt 24:9; Lu 21:17; Ac 9:14; Jas 2:7 denied. Mt 10:23; 1Ti 5:8; 2Ti 2:12; Jude 1:3,4 was. Ac 22:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-14","title":"Revelation 2:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>I have. 4,20 Balaam. Nu 24:14; 25:1-3; 31:8,16; Jos 24:9; 2Pe 2:15; Jude 1:11 a stumbling-block. Isa 57:14; Jer 6:21; Eze 3:20; 44:12; Mt 18:7; Ro 9:32; 11:9 Ro 14:13,21; 1Co 1:23; 8:9; 1Pe 2:8 eat. 20; Ac 15:20,21,29; 21:25; 1Co 8:4-13; 10:18-31 to commit. 21:8; 22:15; 1Co 6:13-18; 7:2; Heb 13:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-15","title":"Revelation 2:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>the doctrine. 6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-16","title":"Revelation 2:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Repent. 5,21,22; 3:19; 16:9; Ac 17:30,31 else. 5 will fight. 12; 1:16; 19:15,21; Isa 11:4; 49:2; Eph 6:17; 2Th 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-17","title":"Revelation 2:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>hath. 7,11; 3:6,13,22 to eat. Ps 25:14; 36:8; Pr 3:32; 14:10; Isa 65:13; Mt 13:11; Joh 4:32 Joh 6:48-58; Col 3:3 a new. 3:12; 19:12,13; Isa 56:4; 65:15 saving. 1Co 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-18","title":"Revelation 2:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>unto. 1; 1:11 the Son. Ps 2:7; Mt 3:17; 4:3-6; 17:5; 27:54; Lu 1:35; Joh 1:14,49 Joh 3:16,18,35,36; 5:25; 10:36; Ac 8:37; Ro 1:4; 8:32 who. 1:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-19","title":"Revelation 2:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>know. 2,9,13 charity. 1Co 13:1-8; Col 3:14; 1Th 3:6; 2Th 1:3; 1Ti 1:5; 1Pe 4:8; 2Pe 1:7 patience. 3 the last. 4; Job 17:9; Ps 92:14; Pr 4:18; Joh 15:2; 2Pe 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-20","title":"Revelation 2:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>I have. 4,14 that woman. 1Ki 16:31; 17:4,13; 19:1,2; 21:7-15,23-25; 2Ki 9:7,30-37 and to seduce. 14; Ex 34:15; Nu 25:1,2; Ac 15:20,29; 1Co 8:10-12; 10:18-21,28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-2-21","title":"Revelation 2:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2